flowchart TD
  A[Human correction with original evidence] --> B[Classify error and scope]
  B --> C{One-off or reusable?}
  C -->|One-off| D[Correct record with history]
  C -->|Reusable| E[Draft rule memory prompt or tool change]
  E --> F[Owner reviews scope and effective date]
  F --> G[Regression plus held-out scenarios]
  G --> H{Quality and cost gates met?}
  H -->|No| E
  H -->|Yes| I[Versioned release and canary]
  I --> J[Monitor real outcomes and rollback]
